                        <tr>
                           <td>Detectable HIV-1 RNA viral load (30,370 copies/mL) is present, indicating active viral replication. This result suggests either untreated HIV infection or possible treatment failure if the patient is on antiretroviral therapy. Clinical correlation and further management are recommended.</td>
